.TH KTX 1 "2026-10-27" "ktx (Rust port)" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ktx \- unified tool for KTX2 texture files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ktx
[\-\-help | \-\-version] | ktx <command> [OPTION...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ktx
creates, converts, encodes, transcodes, inspects, validates and compares KTX (Khronos
Texture) files. Each operation is a subcommand with its own options.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B convert
convert a KTX1 file to KTX2
.TP
.B create
create a KTX2 file from images or raw data
.TP
.B deflate
supercompress a KTX2 file with zstd or zlib
.TP
.B encode
encode a KTX2 file to ASTC, Basis-LZ or UASTC
.TP
.B extract
extract images from a KTX2 file
.TP
.B transcode
transcode a Basis Universal KTX2 file
.TP
.B info
print information about a KTX file
.TP
.B validate
check a KTX2 file against the specification
.TP
.B compare
compare two KTX files
.TP
.B help
show the manual page of a command
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
ktx create \-\-format R8G8B8A8_SRGB \-\-generate\-mipmap in.png out.ktx2
.fi
.PP
.nf
ktx info out.ktx2
.fi
.SH NOTES
This is an unofficial Rust port of Khronos KTX\-Software (libktx and the ktx CLI); it is not
the Khronos build of the tool. The complete, current option list is printed by
.B ktx \-\-help.
.SH SEE ALSO
ktx_convert(1), ktx_create(1), ktx_deflate(1), ktx_encode(1), ktx_extract(1), ktx_transcode(1), ktx_info(1), ktx_validate(1), ktx_compare(1), ktx_help(1)
